# Schedule config for cto-agent (Rex Rivet, docs/17-executive-team.md §16)
# — sourced (POSIX sh) by scripts/agent-scheduled-run.sh and
# scripts/agent-schedule-install.sh. See docs/agent-automation-setup.md.

# Mac mini local time is Pacific (docs/17 §21.1). 8 runs, an hour after each of
# Pip's: 10:00 12:00 14:00 16:00 23:00 01:00 03:00 05:00 CT. The 16:00 CT run
# (14:00 here) also posts the daily roll-up to #executive-team.
# Re-run `scripts/agent-schedule-install.sh install cto-agent` after changing this.
SCHEDULE="08:00 10:00 12:00 14:00=DAILY 21:00 23:00 01:00 03:00"

# One review pass per fire; there is no NEW/REVISE split for a reviewer.
KIND=operations

PROMPT_NEW="Scheduled code review for $(date '+%a %b %-d, %H:%M'). Follow your 'Each run' section: read the rubric and your inbox, review every open devx/ PR at a revision you haven't reviewed, mark each on GitHub and in #tech-team, and post the summary to #tech-team."

# The 14:00 slot: the usual run, plus the daily roll-up to #executive-team.
PROMPT_DAILY="$PROMPT_NEW Then post the daily roll-up of the last 24 hours to #executive-team (your 'The daily roll-up' section)."

# Team Chat against Prod. No ops tools.
TEAM_CHAT_ENV=PROD
